# The rebuild: rolechange.go's last hunk. rel-hadr-s2 (376) replaced the three-line Patroni call the old patch sat on
# with 'seen, _ := r["patroni_session"].(bool)' and a call under !info.Kind.Managed(): the Aurora-reader note block
